{"product_id":"right-parenting-new-age-parenting-and-child-health-handbook","title":"Right Parenting: New Age Parenting and Child-Health Handbook","description":"\u003cp\u003eIs my baby normal Should I apply besan to make the baby fairer Does shaving off hair completely in infancy stimulate better hair growth Bottle-Feeding Boon or bane Do vaccines have serious side effects Is my childs growth normal Temper Tantrums How much time should my child spend with gadgets Should I start antibiotics for high feverWritten from an Indian parenting perspective Right Parenting - New Age Parenting and Child-Health Handbook guides you through topics such as baby care child nutrition child psychology general parenting tips and managing common health problems to name a few This book provides one with scientifically correct and timely guidance about basic parenting and child health concepts using jargon-free everyday language Packed with real life scenarios myth versus reality sections and plain thinking aloud articles Right Parenting is the go-to parenting manual\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 203 x 47\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dr. Mandar V. Bichu\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788179918562\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 394\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684522844313,"sku":"2RD9788179918562","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68b310b1432c0_Right_Parenting-_New_Age_Parenting_and_Child-Health_Handbook_Dr._Mandar_V._Bichu.jpg?v=1756576933","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/right-parenting-new-age-parenting-and-child-health-handbook","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}